    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f\u2757\u2757 Important Notice: Location Permission Pop-Up \u2757\u2757\u26a0\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support! We\u2019ve recently received a few reports about a location permission pop-up appearing in our games. If you see this prompt, feel free to <strong><i><u>decline it</u></i></strong>. The game should work just fine without needing any location data. Rest assured, we haven\u2019t programmed our games to request location access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively looking into what\u2019s causing this. For context, our games are built using the Construct 3 engine, which relies on HTML5 technology, and this might be related to the issue. One possibility (though we\u2019re not certain yet) is that a recent Windows update could be triggering these prompts for web-based applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter this pop-up, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could take a screenshot and send it to us at <u>ub@noobzilla.games</u>. Your help will go a long way in helping us resolve this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and we apologize for any inconvenience. We truly value your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UB</p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a MORE UPCOMING GAMES! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1751633523\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.poster.avif?t=1751633523\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.webm?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.mp4?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the fifth title of Cats and Seek series. In celebration of Toge Productions' anniversary, we will explore Toge Land and greet the cats there \ud83d\ude03<br> <br>\ud83d\ude3b Let's play hide and seek with the cats at Toge Land! <br>\u2764\ufe0f \u200a\u200a\u200a\u200aCan you find them all? \u2764\ufe0f <br> <br>\ud83c\udfae 1 Level - \ud83d\ude3b 105 cats - \ud83d\udd06 Brightness setting <br>\ud83d\udd14 Free hints - \ud83d\udcbe Save system - \ud83d\udd0d Zoom <br>\ud83d\udd09 Cute cat sounds - \ud83c\udfae Gamepad compatible <br> <br> <br><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Choose your favorite color</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d331e25d948eb607d6f2b8d287736687.poster.avif?t=1751633523\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d331e25d948eb607d6f2b8d287736687.webm?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/d331e25d948eb607d6f2b8d287736687.mp4?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcf7 Photo mode</strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/38d4d88cbc3fdbc0de19f2950ed13707.poster.avif?t=1751633523\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/38d4d88cbc3fdbc0de19f2950ed13707.webm?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/38d4d88cbc3fdbc0de19f2950ed13707.mp4?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 5 Musics</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/37a3647243d9ed813c145a9a2e4b92dd.poster.avif?t=1751633523\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/37a3647243d9ed813c145a9a2e4b92dd.webm?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145350/extras/37a3647243d9ed813c145a9a2e4b92dd.mp4?t=1751633523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
